# {{project_name}}

{{project_description}}

A command-line tool written entirely in hand-written ARM64 assembly for Apple Silicon macOS. Clang is used only as assembler and linker driver; the binary links `libSystem` through the standard dynamic linker and issues no raw syscalls.

## Usage

```bash
{{project_name}} sum <file|->
```

Reads decimal integers, one per line, and reports the count, sum and maximum:

```console
$ printf '5\n-7\n12\n0\n' | {{project_name}} sum -
count=4 sum=10 max=12
```

Exit status is `0` on success, `1` on a runtime failure (unreadable input, a malformed line, a value out of range, or empty input), and `2` on a usage error.

## Getting started

```bash
just init     # check prerequisites and activate the pre-commit hook
just build    # assemble and link
just test     # unit, CLI and disassembly tests
just ci       # every validation check
just help     # all recipes
```

## Prerequisites

- **Xcode Command Line Tools** — `clang`, `otool`, `nm`, `lipo`, `codesign`, `lldb`
- **Homebrew LLVM** (`brew install llvm`) — `FileCheck`, `llvm-objdump`, `llvm-readobj`, `llvm-mca`
- `just`, `semgrep`, `codespell`, `shellcheck`, `shfmt`

`just check` verifies all of these and fails with an install hint for anything missing.

## Layout

```text
src/main.S        argv handling, dispatch, exit status
src/lib/io.S      the only module that calls libSystem
src/lib/parse.S   decimal parsing        (pure leaf)
src/lib/stats.S   running statistics     (pure leaf)
src/lib/fmt.S     decimal formatting     (pure leaf)
include/abi.inc   FUNC / FRAME_PUSH macros carrying the ABI guarantees
tests/unit/       assembly test executables
tests/cli/        black-box tests of the built binary
tests/binary/     FileCheck assertions over real disassembly
config/           allowlists, Semgrep rules, codespell dictionary
scripts/          the guardrail scripts behind the code-* recipes
```

## Guardrails

Assembly has no semantic source analyser, so validation is layered differently from a compiled-language project:

| Recipe | Enforces |
| --- | --- |
| `code-style` | source hygiene and a mechanical ARM64 style policy |
| `code-semgrep` | no `svc`, no `x18`, no suppressions, no private symbols, no absolute paths |
| `code-lspchecks` | Clang integrated-assembler validation with fatal warnings |
| `code-abi` | ABI macro discipline and test coverage of every export |
| `code-architecture` | only `io.o` may import libSystem |
| `code-security` | exact-equality import and dylib allowlists, valid signature |
| `code-binary` | arm64-only, macOS 11 minimum, no weak dylibs, no W+X segments |

`just perf-mca` prints an `llvm-mca` throughput report. It is informational and deliberately excluded from `ci`.
